# Chain-of-custody / audit artifacts: requirements-lock.txt,
# third_party_licenses.json, and the root-level *.provenance.json sidecars
# (calibration-images.provenance.json, calibration-text.txt.provenance.json)
# are intentionally TRACKED, not ignored -- see PROVENANCE.md and
# THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Only their transient .tmp write targets are
# ignored here.
*.provenance.json.tmp
requirements-lock.txt.tmp
third_party_licenses.json.tmp
